Hi all,

A source-publication correction to my previous update: I omitted the
worker integration from the first Git commit/source archive. The tested
debs already contained it. The complete source is now committed, and a
corrected source revision with the same tested binary packages is here:

https://github.com/rdmitry0911/qsm-rd/releases/tag/v0.4.0-qsm-direct-20261027=
-exact-ui-exp6-source1

The earlier experimental tag is retained and its release page points to
this revision. Please use the new source archive/tag. Runtime/build
sources were checked byte for byte against the snapshot used to build
the exp6 debs; their package version and binary hashes are unchanged.
The measurements and limitations in my previous update still apply.

Sorry for the publication error.
Dmitry
